<div n="3"><head><hi rendition="#g">Schleswig-Hol&#x017F;tein</hi>.</head><lb/>
<div n="4" type="jArticle"><dateline><hi rendition="#b">* Schleswig,</hi> 1 April.</dateline><lb/>
